### Event System BE — REST collection (VS Code "REST Client" / JetBrains http client)
### Prereqs: pnpm start (with docker compose postgres up). Auth uses the x-user-id dev stub.

@base = http://localhost:3000/v1
@owner = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@userA = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
@userB = 44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444

### Create an event
# @name createEvent
POST {{base}}/events
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{owner}}

{
  "titleVi": "Họp toàn công ty",
  "titleJa": "全社ミーティング",
  "type": "INTERNAL_MEETING",
  "startAt": "2026-07-10T02:00:00.000Z",
  "endAt": "2026-07-10T04:00:00.000Z",
  "registrationMode": "INDIVIDUAL"
}

@eventId = {{createEvent.response.body.id}}

### List events (localized title)
GET {{base}}/events?lang=ja

### Publish (organizer only)
POST {{base}}/events/{{eventId}}/publish
x-user-id: {{owner}}

### Open registration
POST {{base}}/events/{{eventId}}/open-registration
x-user-id: {{owner}}

### Reschedule (auto close/reopen if registration is open)
PATCH {{base}}/events/{{eventId}}/schedule
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{owner}}

{ "startAt": "2026-08-01T02:00:00.000Z", "endAt": "2026-08-01T04:00:00.000Z" }

### Register (individual)
# @name register
POST {{base}}/events/{{eventId}}/registrations
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{userA}}

{ "mode": "INDIVIDUAL" }

@registrationId = {{register.response.body.id}}

### Register (team)
POST {{base}}/events/{{eventId}}/registrations
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{userB}}

{ "mode": "TEAM", "teamName": "Team Alpha", "memberIds": ["44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444"] }

### List registrations
GET {{base}}/events/{{eventId}}/registrations

### Check-in (organizer scans QR)
POST {{base}}/registrations/{{registrationId}}/check-in
x-user-id: {{owner}}

### Cancel registration (registrant only)
POST {{base}}/registrations/{{registrationId}}/cancel
x-user-id: {{userA}}

### Cancel the event
POST {{base}}/events/{{eventId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{owner}}

{ "reason": "Trùng lịch hội trường" }
